  "extraction_notes": [
    "RDS(on) has two published condition rows: 4.0 mOhm typical and 5.8 mOhm maximum at VGS = 10 V, ID = 25 A; 5.8 mOhm typical and 8.0 mOhm maximum at VGS = 4.5 V, ID = 20 A.",
    "Gate charge is Qg = 15 nC typical and 23 nC maximum at VDS = 15 V, ID = 20 A, VGS = 4.5 V endpoint; Qgs1 = 3.7 nC, Qgs2 = 1.9 nC, Qgd = 5.7 nC typical.",
    "Body-diode forward voltage is 0.95 V typical from Fig. 7 at TJ = 25 degC, IS = 20 A, VGS = 0 V; the table gives 1.0 V maximum under the same condition.",
    "Body-diode reverse recovery is trr = 24 ns typical and 36 ns maximum; Qrr = 52 nC typical and 78 nC maximum at TJ = 25 degC, IF = 20 A, VDD = 15 V, di/dt = 300 A/us.",
    "Thermal resistances are RthetaJC = 2.0 K/W maximum and RthetaJA = 50 K/W maximum on PCB mount, or 110 K/W maximum for the other stated junction-to-ambient condition.",
    "Capacitance curves are typical traces at VGS = 0 V and f = 1 MHz; tabulated capacitances are specified at VDS = 15 V."
  ],
